WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:23.360 --> 00:30.120
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

3
00:30.120 --> 00:35.800
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

4
00:35.800 --> 00:38.400
♪ I don't understand ♪

5
00:38.400 --> 00:43.920
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

6
00:43.920 --> 00:48.720
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪

7
00:49.080 --> 00:55.040
♪ Will we ever get to love each other? ♪

8
00:56.920 --> 01:01.040
As for the contract, I'll take care of it tomorrow and send it back to you.

9
01:01.440 --> 01:04.319
You know what I want now, right?

10
01:05.760 --> 01:07.880
I want my woman back.

11
01:09.920 --> 01:11.160
Does Uncle know yet?

12
01:11.160 --> 01:12.800
I've already informed the chairman's secretary

13
01:12.800 --> 01:15.560
that Mr. Songsak finalized the deal with Mr. Techin this morning.

14
01:16.760 --> 01:18.160
I'll go to the office right away.

15
01:23.640 --> 01:25.039
I want an explanation.

16
01:26.160 --> 01:28.440
Someone reported to me that we failed to secure the deal.

17
01:28.440 --> 01:31.320
Songsak signed with a competitor this morning.

18
01:32.360 --> 01:35.640
Didn't you promise you'd handle this properly?

19
01:36.360 --> 01:39.000
I have no explanation. It was my mistake.

20
01:39.560 --> 01:41.000
Is it because of that woman?

21
01:42.039 --> 01:43.759
Phat told me everything.

22
01:44.680 --> 01:46.880
You delivered her to the place.

23
01:46.880 --> 01:47.920
Then what happened?

24
01:48.520 --> 01:51.759
Trading a woman for a contract isn't work, Dad.

25
01:51.759 --> 01:53.840
Why is it not, Peem?

26
01:53.840 --> 01:57.440
It's business. We give them what they want in exchange for what we want.

27
01:57.840 --> 01:59.240
If it were an object, I wouldn't mind.

28
01:59.240 --> 02:01.320
But it's a person. Don't you understand, Dad?

29
02:01.320 --> 02:04.080
Peem, you've never acted like this before.

30
02:04.480 --> 02:07.040
You didn't show up at the company. You didn't answer your phone. You ran away from problems.

31
02:07.040 --> 02:10.520
Do you know how much the company lost because of what you did?

32
02:13.800 --> 02:17.200
The Peem that I knew would never do this.

33
02:30.200 --> 02:31.400
How did it go?

34
02:44.360 --> 02:45.280
Let's go home.

35
02:55.680 --> 02:58.000
Mr. Songsak signed with someone else?

36
02:58.760 --> 02:59.640
Yeah.

37
03:00.640 --> 03:02.080
Then what are you going to do?

38
03:02.800 --> 03:03.720
There's nothing I can do.

39
03:05.800 --> 03:07.120
But no matter how many times I had to choose,

40
03:11.040 --> 03:12.600
I'd still choose you.

41
03:18.880 --> 03:21.360
I'm sorry for making you feel bad that night.

42
03:43.040 --> 03:44.680
You see those stars?

43
03:50.560 --> 03:53.320
You don't usually see them in the city because there are so many lights.

44
03:55.720 --> 03:57.480
In big cities like this, there are so many successful people.

45
03:57.880 --> 04:01.320
Just like those stars.

46
04:03.800 --> 04:06.400
But there will be one star that stands out more than the others.

47
04:07.400 --> 04:08.880
No matter how many lights there are,

48
04:10.760 --> 04:12.280
they can never overshadow it.

49
04:16.000 --> 04:17.320
That's just like you.

50
04:18.600 --> 04:20.800
No one can make you lose your light.

51
04:25.440 --> 04:27.440
Are you trying to make me feel better?

52
04:31.680 --> 04:33.800
I believe you can get through this.

53
04:34.960 --> 04:36.600
As long as you don't give up,

54
04:37.120 --> 04:39.120
you'll always find a way forward.

55
04:50.080 --> 04:51.520
It's actually you.

56
04:51.920 --> 04:53.760
You're the little star

57
04:54.240 --> 04:56.680
that's shining the brightest in my life right now.

58
05:49.159 --> 05:52.080
(Techin - Please call me back. It's urgent.)

59
06:00.880 --> 06:02.040
What is it? You said it's urgent.

60
06:04.760 --> 06:06.000
I can't do that today.

61
06:07.400 --> 06:09.920
But I will call you back when it's convenient.

62
06:16.520 --> 06:18.280
Oh, you're up?

63
06:18.280 --> 06:19.800
You were asleep, so I didn't want to wake you up.

64
06:20.480 --> 06:22.440
I'm going to keep you company at work.

65
06:27.720 --> 06:30.800
You told me that just staying by your side is enough.

66
06:32.400 --> 06:34.840
So I want to be by your side

67
06:34.840 --> 06:36.880
when you have to face things like this.

68
06:41.960 --> 06:45.080
Why do you have to say such sweet things like that right now?

69
06:46.840 --> 06:48.600
We won't make it to work.

70
06:51.800 --> 06:52.920
I'm going to take a shower.

71
06:55.320 --> 06:56.520
Are you inviting me?

72
06:59.280 --> 07:00.280
I'm not.

73
07:00.600 --> 07:02.360
I'm going to hurry and take a shower.

74
07:02.760 --> 07:04.560
I don't want you to be late for work.

75
07:07.480 --> 07:08.760
I'll get going.

76
07:30.040 --> 07:31.000
Shall we go now?

77
07:36.640 --> 07:37.760
Not yet.

78
07:54.200 --> 07:55.920
Aren't you in a rush to leave for work?

79
07:57.000 --> 07:57.920
I am.

80
08:01.320 --> 08:03.880
If you're in a rush, I can do it myself.

81
08:04.480 --> 08:07.240
No. No matter how much of a rush I'm in, you always come first.

82
08:44.760 --> 08:46.840
This doesn't concern you. Leave.

83
08:46.840 --> 08:47.880
I need to talk with my daughter.

84
08:49.240 --> 08:50.240
Yes.

85
08:57.600 --> 09:00.920
Is this the woman? The whore you picked up from a bar?

86
09:03.800 --> 09:05.240
Couldn't you find anyone else?

87
09:06.240 --> 09:07.960
I don't care that she's a woman.

88
09:08.360 --> 09:11.880
But I do mind that you picked up a random nobody and decided to wife her up.

89
09:18.640 --> 09:19.760
Have you seen this news?

90
09:19.760 --> 09:20.720
(Real estate empire heir, Peem, Phakanee Traisuvetthiwat)

91
09:20.720 --> 09:21.640
(Still happy and in love after losing a major deal to a competitor)

92
09:25.560 --> 09:28.240
You haven't even settled the contract issue with the board yet.

93
09:28.600 --> 09:30.360
And now you've caused a new problem.

94
09:31.960 --> 09:33.920
Do you realize how much of a mess you caused?

95
09:34.880 --> 09:36.720
Don't blame me, Dad.

96
09:36.720 --> 09:38.840
I'm not blaming you. I'm blaming that whore.

97
09:39.400 --> 09:40.440
Dad.

98
09:40.800 --> 09:43.600
You shouldn't look down on her like that. It's just her job.

99
09:44.200 --> 09:46.880
What? Her job is just sitting and lying around.

100
09:46.880 --> 09:48.600
That's what she's good at.

101
09:48.600 --> 09:50.080
What's so special about it?

102
09:50.080 --> 09:53.560
I just don't get why you made her your personal assistant.

103
09:53.560 --> 09:55.880
You just have her lounging around the house.

104
09:57.160 --> 09:59.560
Are you being stupid and getting fooled by a whore?

105
09:59.560 --> 10:00.560
Dad!

106
10:01.760 --> 10:03.120
Let me tell you something.

107
10:03.120 --> 10:05.480
This kind of person always chooses money.

108
10:05.480 --> 10:07.840
They'll go with whoever has it. Just like...

109
10:08.240 --> 10:09.480
Why did you stop?

110
10:09.800 --> 10:12.800
Did you just realize that you're no different from me?

111
10:17.760 --> 10:19.080
Yes, I was stupid.

112
10:19.880 --> 10:21.960
I once fell for this kind of person.

113
10:22.960 --> 10:24.560
That's why I'm warning you.

114
10:25.840 --> 10:27.440
I don't want you to get hurt.

115
10:27.440 --> 10:30.080
Because in the end, she'll choose money, not you.

116
10:30.080 --> 10:31.120
I don't care.

117
10:31.120 --> 10:33.600
You could love Mom. I can love Parn too.

118
10:33.600 --> 10:35.800
I believe that she's not with me because of money.

119
10:35.800 --> 10:37.200
Unlike what Mom did to you.

120
11:10.320 --> 11:11.200
Hey.

121
11:59.400 --> 12:01.680
You heard everything my dad and I talked about?

122
12:05.000 --> 12:05.880
Yes.

123
12:27.240 --> 12:28.920
My mom's a sex worker.

124
12:31.400 --> 12:32.800
My relatives told me...

125
12:34.360 --> 12:36.160
she intentionally got pregnant to trap my dad.

126
12:37.560 --> 12:38.960
After she gave birth to me,

127
12:40.400 --> 12:43.320
she demanded money from my dad in exchange for me.

128
12:49.040 --> 12:50.960
I have no memories of my mom,

129
12:52.600 --> 12:54.320
only of what she did,

130
12:55.960 --> 12:58.400
and what I heard from my relatives.

131
13:08.320 --> 13:12.360
When I met you at Paradise that day, I thought you're like my mom.

132
13:13.600 --> 13:16.560
Trying to land a rich partner to improve your life.

133
13:17.240 --> 13:19.920
Trying to get close to me for money and a comfortable life.

134
13:21.280 --> 13:24.120
But after I got to know you and spent some time with you,

135
13:26.680 --> 13:29.000
I realized you'd never be like my mom.

136
13:32.560 --> 13:34.280
Because money can't buy you.

137
13:43.320 --> 13:45.080
Money can buy my time.

138
13:46.560 --> 13:48.280
But it can't buy me.

139
14:03.040 --> 14:05.080
I'm sorry for everything.

140
14:06.040 --> 14:07.680
You don't need to apologize.

141
14:09.200 --> 14:11.240
It's enough that you understand.

142
14:11.240 --> 14:18.520
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

143
14:18.520 --> 14:23.120
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

144
14:23.640 --> 14:26.360
♪ I don't understand ♪

145
14:26.360 --> 14:31.840
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

146
14:31.840 --> 14:36.560
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪

147
14:37.120 --> 14:42.160
♪ Will we ever get to love each other? ♪

148
14:50.360 --> 14:53.560
If the revenue keeps dropping, I'm gonna need to shut the place down.

149
15:09.960 --> 15:13.640
(Parn)

150
15:24.240 --> 15:27.040
Mr. Te, why are you here? We're not open yet.

151
15:27.400 --> 15:29.480
I haven't been able to get a hold of Parn lately.

152
15:31.800 --> 15:32.880
I also...

153
15:33.880 --> 15:35.360
haven't been in touch with her.

154
15:36.720 --> 15:40.200
She said she'd call me back when it's convenient but she hasn't called me yet.

155
15:40.560 --> 15:44.120
Maybe she's decided to leave this line of work.

156
15:44.760 --> 15:47.200
You mean Parn isn't coming back to work?

157
15:48.840 --> 15:50.440
She won't accept me as a client anymore?

158
15:53.480 --> 15:55.320
Isn't that a good thing, though?

159
15:55.320 --> 15:58.640
A woman has managed to leave this place.

160
16:15.040 --> 16:16.920
You're still thinking about it?

161
16:19.240 --> 16:20.520
I tried to stop.

162
16:22.040 --> 16:25.400
But I can't help it. I keep thinking about it.

163
16:30.760 --> 16:33.160
You don't have to go to the office tomorrow, right?

164
16:43.480 --> 16:44.720
Don't overthink it.

165
16:45.880 --> 16:49.200
I'm just having a fight with my dad.

166
16:55.800 --> 16:57.560
I was just about to ask

167
16:58.400 --> 17:00.800
if I can skip going to the office tomorrow.

168
17:04.680 --> 17:06.480
I want to take a baking class.

169
17:10.200 --> 17:11.400
Sure.

170
17:11.400 --> 17:12.640
Where do you want to go?

171
17:13.079 --> 17:14.560
I'll take care of the fees.

172
17:19.640 --> 17:21.520
I'm not asking for your money.

173
17:23.920 --> 17:25.680
But I want to pay for you.

174
17:34.280 --> 17:35.440
I told you...

175
17:37.720 --> 17:39.280
because I wanted to ask for your permission.

176
17:44.160 --> 17:45.880
If doing something makes you happy,

177
17:47.640 --> 17:49.120
you can go ahead and do it.

178
18:11.640 --> 18:13.240
You sure you don't want a ride?

179
18:13.240 --> 18:15.200
Yes, I'll go there myself.

180
18:15.760 --> 18:17.640
Drive safely and get home early, okay?

181
18:19.240 --> 18:21.360
Do your best, okay? See you later.

182
18:37.560 --> 18:38.680
"Okay?"

183
18:55.920 --> 18:56.920
Hello, Dad.

184
19:27.400 --> 19:28.920
Have you talked to your dad?

185
19:30.440 --> 19:31.440
No.

186
19:52.960 --> 19:56.240
Parn, will you stay by my side like this, always?

187
20:00.040 --> 20:01.080
You called me Parn?

188
20:02.680 --> 20:04.040
Your name is Parn.

189
20:05.280 --> 20:06.880
But you don't normally refer to me by my name.

190
20:07.760 --> 20:08.920
I do now.

191
20:34.560 --> 20:36.000
Hello, Mr. Te.

192
20:36.000 --> 20:38.720
Where are you, Parn? You told me you'd call me back when it's convenient.

193
20:39.560 --> 20:42.160
But you never called, so I wanted to give it a try.

194
20:43.360 --> 20:44.880
Is there anything you want?

195
20:46.720 --> 20:48.600
I want to warn you about Mr. Songsak.

196
20:49.400 --> 20:50.880
He won't give up easily.

197
20:51.840 --> 20:54.840
He told me if he can't have you, no one can.

198
20:56.080 --> 20:57.640
I think he's going to do something.

199
20:58.680 --> 21:00.240
Okay, I'll be careful.

200
21:01.640 --> 21:03.360
I don't think he'll do anything to you, Parn.

201
21:04.360 --> 21:07.400
You mean he's going to hurt Ms. Peem?

202
21:07.880 --> 21:09.120
Are you free today?

203
21:09.520 --> 21:10.640
Can you come see me?

204
21:11.240 --> 21:13.760
Okay, then let's meet at 3 p.m.

205
21:20.800 --> 21:23.280
Mr. Songsak doesn't know how to lose.

206
21:24.320 --> 21:26.480
You said he's going to hurt Ms. Peem.

207
21:27.000 --> 21:28.640
Is it because of this?

208
21:30.480 --> 21:31.360
Yes.

209
21:32.800 --> 21:34.720
Ms. Peem got in his way.

210
21:35.200 --> 21:36.520
And she humiliated him.

211
21:39.880 --> 21:42.400
Could you help me find a way to meet him?

212
22:01.240 --> 22:02.400
Sis.

213
22:10.600 --> 22:11.640
Why are you back?

214
22:13.360 --> 22:15.240
I joined a baking class today.

215
22:18.400 --> 22:19.840
I baked some for you too.

216
22:25.640 --> 22:26.680
Keep it.

217
22:27.120 --> 22:28.160
It makes me fat.

218
22:33.360 --> 22:34.320
Sis.

219
22:37.200 --> 22:40.440
Are you mad at me for not telling you myself?

220
22:47.880 --> 22:48.920
I'm sorry.

221
22:51.080 --> 22:52.600
I just didn't have the courage.

222
22:54.000 --> 22:55.040
I was afraid.

223
22:55.880 --> 22:57.440
I didn't how to say it.

224
22:59.320 --> 23:00.840
Just say you want to quit.

225
23:07.000 --> 23:09.000
But you're like my older sister.

226
23:11.400 --> 23:12.960
You've been taking care of me since I was a kid.

227
23:14.520 --> 23:17.000
You gave me the chance that got me to where I am today.

228
23:19.880 --> 23:21.720
I don't want you to think that...

229
23:22.920 --> 23:25.040
all ties are severed after I quit.

230
23:27.680 --> 23:29.240
But I want them to be severed.

231
23:32.360 --> 23:33.320
Sis.

232
23:42.680 --> 23:45.160
I don't want you to come back and work this job again.

233
23:47.520 --> 23:49.800
I want you to go and have a good life.

234
23:50.520 --> 23:52.280
Marry a rich person.

235
23:58.520 --> 24:00.640
I will never cut ties with you.

236
24:02.960 --> 24:04.000
Never.

237
24:22.080 --> 24:23.480
Does she take good care of you?

238
24:34.520 --> 24:36.600
Does she show respect to my Angel?

239
24:46.920 --> 24:49.080
If one day she hurts you,

240
24:50.320 --> 24:51.720
you will always have me.

241
24:52.120 --> 24:53.400
You know that, right?

242
25:32.560 --> 25:34.200
It was on sale, so I bought it.

243
25:36.760 --> 25:39.640
That means you remember that I like it.

244
25:42.480 --> 25:43.360
Yeah.

245
25:44.880 --> 25:46.760
Why are you back early today?

246
25:52.440 --> 25:54.080
There's nothing left to handle at the office.

247
25:56.520 --> 25:58.080
That means you missed me.

248
26:01.520 --> 26:02.440
Yeah.

249
26:05.280 --> 26:07.160
And why are you back late today?

250
26:08.560 --> 26:10.240
I stopped to buy some things.

251
26:13.120 --> 26:14.760
Next time, wait for me and we'll go together.

252
26:14.760 --> 26:17.080
You don't have a car, and things are heavy.

253
26:17.080 --> 26:18.520
You should wait, so I can help you carry them.

254
26:19.080 --> 26:20.040
Okay?

255
26:23.560 --> 26:24.480
Okay.

256
26:32.320 --> 26:33.680
What's wrong, Parn?

257
26:42.680 --> 26:43.720
What is it?

258
26:49.720 --> 26:52.680
I don't know how long this happiness will last.

259
27:04.000 --> 27:05.080
It'll be long.

260
27:06.440 --> 27:07.960
It could even last a lifetime.

261
27:09.760 --> 27:11.640
I want to be with you, Peem.

262
27:15.320 --> 27:17.040
I want to be with you all day and all night.

263
27:26.240 --> 27:28.280
♪ We both said some awful words ♪

264
27:28.280 --> 27:30.520
♪ And I know that we both got hurt ♪

265
27:30.520 --> 27:31.880
♪ But I wanna be with you ♪

266
27:32.600 --> 27:34.080
♪ I wanna be with you ♪

267
27:34.480 --> 27:36.760
♪ We can't let this slip away ♪

268
27:36.760 --> 27:39.040
♪ You know that I want you to stay ♪

269
27:39.040 --> 27:40.680
♪ 'Cause I wanna be with you ♪

270
27:41.240 --> 27:42.560
♪ I wanna be with you ♪

271
27:42.560 --> 27:44.000
♪ Don't run away ♪

272
27:44.000 --> 27:46.120
♪ We can't let this go to waste ♪

273
27:46.120 --> 27:50.000
♪ I don't want nobody else ♪

274
27:50.560 --> 27:52.280
♪ Don't let this go to waste ♪

275
27:52.280 --> 27:54.120
♪ Baby, we can work it out ♪

276
27:54.120 --> 27:56.080
♪ Maybe you can stay the night ♪

277
27:56.080 --> 27:58.320
♪ I wanna be with you ♪

278
27:58.320 --> 27:59.320
♪ I wanna be with you ♪

279
27:59.320 --> 28:01.040
♪ Don't let this go to waste ♪

280
28:01.040 --> 28:02.480
♪ I don't wanna let you go ♪

281
28:02.480 --> 28:04.720
♪ I just wanna let you know ♪

282
28:04.720 --> 28:06.920
♪ I wanna be with you ♪

283
28:06.920 --> 28:08.600
♪ I wanna be with you ♪

284
28:09.320 --> 28:12.040
♪ Hope that we can work it out ♪

285
28:12.040 --> 28:13.840
♪ Wanna feel you close to me ♪

286
28:14.200 --> 28:16.320
♪ Wanna feel you close to me ♪

287
28:17.440 --> 28:20.400
♪ I hope that we can work it out ♪

288
28:20.720 --> 28:22.800
♪ Wanna feel you close to me ♪

289
28:22.800 --> 28:25.480
♪ Wanna feel you close to me ♪

290
28:29.000 --> 28:30.040
Please come in.

291
28:34.640 --> 28:35.840
Are you sure, Parn?

292
28:37.520 --> 28:38.360
Yes.

293
28:43.000 --> 28:44.000
Please proceed.

294
28:47.600 --> 28:48.520
You can't go in, ma'am.

295
28:51.080 --> 28:52.760
You two, leave for now.

296
29:01.520 --> 29:03.320
This place suits you better.

297
29:06.960 --> 29:09.240
About that day, it was my fault.

298
29:09.720 --> 29:11.000
Ms. Peem had nothing to do with it.

299
29:15.520 --> 29:16.480
You're worried about her?

300
29:18.240 --> 29:19.680
Will Ms. Peem know

301
29:20.400 --> 29:23.480
you have to do something like this?

302
29:30.400 --> 29:31.800
You just want to win.

303
29:33.040 --> 29:36.000
If you win, can you let this end here?

304
29:40.640 --> 29:42.960
Do you know what I like about someone like you?

305
29:44.480 --> 29:45.520
You're brave.

306
29:47.360 --> 29:48.560
Bold.

307
29:50.960 --> 29:53.520
But the more you try to protect,

308
29:54.800 --> 29:56.520
the more I want to destroy.

309
29:57.560 --> 30:00.280
But I won't touch Ms. Peem

310
30:00.760 --> 30:02.040
if you do as I say.

311
30:18.920 --> 30:19.720
(Peem)

312
30:49.000 --> 30:50.000
Ms. Peem.

313
30:51.040 --> 30:53.600
You just won't let it end and have to do this behind my back, huh?!

314
30:56.760 --> 30:58.720
I was the one who asked Mr. Songsak to come.

315
31:00.400 --> 31:01.440
What?

316
31:02.080 --> 31:03.720
I'm the one who caused the problem.

317
31:04.200 --> 31:07.640
If I'd just gone along with it that day, things wouldn't have reached this point.

318
31:08.920 --> 31:09.760
Parn.

319
31:16.480 --> 31:17.960
What do I have to do to make you stop?

320
31:19.800 --> 31:21.400
You know what I want.

321
31:23.200 --> 31:23.880
Parn.

322
31:25.040 --> 31:26.080
One night.

323
31:26.800 --> 31:28.480
In exchange for a billion-baht business deal.

324
31:28.480 --> 31:29.960
I'm at a disadvantage here, you know?

325
31:30.600 --> 31:32.840
There's no way this woman is worth a billion.

326
31:33.280 --> 31:34.720
Maybe not to you.

327
31:37.320 --> 31:40.160
But to me, Parn is worth more than that.

328
31:44.800 --> 31:48.520
A whore... worth more than a billion?

329
31:49.600 --> 31:50.720
Are you joking?

330
32:00.560 --> 32:01.640
- Ms. Peem. - Ms. Peem.

331
32:09.520 --> 32:11.160
You can do anything to me.

332
32:12.000 --> 32:13.280
But leave Parn alone.

333
32:18.800 --> 32:20.880
If you drink all of these and can still stand,

334
32:20.880 --> 32:23.320
you can take your person and leave.

335
32:24.840 --> 32:27.800
And I’ll consider the things between us over.

336
33:20.920 --> 33:21.800
Parn.

337
34:03.600 --> 34:05.240
Did he do anything to you?

338
34:16.239 --> 34:17.159
Ms. Peem.

339
34:19.040 --> 34:20.199
Ms. Peem.

340
35:05.280 --> 35:06.640
How are you feeling?

341
35:06.640 --> 35:07.680
Are you okay?

342
35:09.120 --> 35:10.520
I'm having a bad headache.

343
35:24.400 --> 35:27.640
I'm sorry for making you worry.

344
35:32.720 --> 35:34.600
I should be the one apologizing.

345
35:36.640 --> 35:38.520
I'm sorry for leaving like that.

346
35:41.240 --> 35:43.160
I'm sorry for doing such a reckless thing.

347
35:43.680 --> 35:46.320
I'm sorry for getting you in trouble.

348
35:49.040 --> 35:51.760
I lied there, listening to the sound of your heart all night,

349
35:53.600 --> 35:55.680
because I was afraid it'd stop beating.

350
36:10.520 --> 36:11.960
It's still beating here.

351
36:15.920 --> 36:17.400
Don't cry anymore.

352
36:27.560 --> 36:29.200
Can you promise me something, Parn?

353
36:31.120 --> 36:32.880
Promise me that you won't lie...

354
36:34.360 --> 36:36.200
and won't put yourself at risk again.

355
36:40.720 --> 36:42.880
Because if something happens to you,

356
36:44.600 --> 36:46.640
my heart won't be able to take it.

357
37:04.360 --> 37:05.840
That day you went to see Mr. Songsak.

358
37:07.040 --> 37:09.080
Did you already know what to expect?

359
37:10.480 --> 37:11.880
I somewhat had an idea.

360
37:12.400 --> 37:13.880
And why did you still go?

361
37:16.480 --> 37:18.320
Because I wanted you to get the job done.

362
37:24.920 --> 37:26.560
Your work is very important to you.

363
37:27.760 --> 37:29.600
I saw that you work very hard.

364
37:31.720 --> 37:35.600
If a woman like me is valuable enough to help you land that billion-baht project,

365
37:37.320 --> 37:38.680
then I should do it.

366
37:51.800 --> 37:53.160
Thank you for loving me.

367
37:56.240 --> 37:59.080
But next time, don't sacrifice so much for me.

368
38:06.160 --> 38:10.440
♪ All of the things that I wish I could tell you ♪

369
38:10.880 --> 38:15.400
♪ Every time when you're passing me by ♪

370
38:15.400 --> 38:17.680
♪ I fall in love ♪

371
38:17.680 --> 38:20.200
♪ There's something about you ♪

372
38:20.200 --> 38:22.520
♪ I wish you were mine ♪

373
38:22.520 --> 38:23.800
It's because I love you.

374
38:25.120 --> 38:29.520
♪ And if I only could be there to hold you ♪

375
38:29.520 --> 38:33.880
♪ It feels like I stop breathing When you're around ♪

376
38:34.240 --> 38:36.440
♪ I'm in love ♪

377
38:36.760 --> 38:39.200
♪ There's something about you ♪

378
38:39.200 --> 38:42.840
♪ I wish you were mine ♪

379
38:46.280 --> 38:48.600
♪ There's something about you ♪

380
38:48.600 --> 38:50.960
♪ I wish you were mine ♪

381
38:54.960 --> 38:56.240
Hangover soup.

382
38:57.200 --> 38:59.360
Can you feed me? My arms are weak.

383
38:59.360 --> 39:00.680
I'm still feeling dizzy.

384
39:03.920 --> 39:05.360
That’s clearly just an excuse.

385
39:05.360 --> 39:07.160
You seemed energetic enough just now.

386
39:29.280 --> 39:30.280
Is it good?

387
39:30.960 --> 39:32.000
Mmm.

388
39:32.000 --> 39:33.000
It's good.

389
39:40.720 --> 39:41.760
Yes, Dad.

390
39:44.280 --> 39:45.200
Okay.

391
39:48.800 --> 39:50.320
Is something wrong?

392
39:50.320 --> 39:53.280
I don't know, but he told me to go the office right away.

393
40:00.640 --> 40:03.760
There's a new investor. They are interested in investing with us.

394
40:04.400 --> 40:05.280
Who are they?

395
40:05.280 --> 40:08.680
Mr. Wang, Managing Director of Wang Capital.

396
40:09.080 --> 40:12.920
The group holds an investment portfolio worth nearly ten billion in Southeast Asia.

397
40:13.400 --> 40:15.880
They are looking for a flagship project in Bangkok.

398
40:15.880 --> 40:18.240
Are they working on the same kind of project as us?

399
40:18.640 --> 40:19.600
Yeah.

400
40:20.560 --> 40:23.400
And Mr. Wang isn't like Songsak.

401
40:23.400 --> 40:26.080
He’s a rational person. He doesn't let emotions affect his work.

402
40:26.080 --> 40:28.680
If he sees that our project can generate profits,

403
40:29.120 --> 40:31.000
he’ll likely invest with us.

404
40:31.000 --> 40:32.040
I can make it happen.

405
40:36.920 --> 40:38.040
Uh, Dad.

406
40:40.280 --> 40:41.240
What is it?

407
40:50.920 --> 40:52.280
I'm sorry...

408
40:53.800 --> 40:55.440
for speaking rudely to you.

409
41:00.720 --> 41:02.120
I was also too harsh on you.

410
41:03.240 --> 41:04.400
I'm sorry too.

411
41:08.680 --> 41:11.720
This time, I won't let you down.

412
41:15.680 --> 41:17.080
You're a grown-up now, Peem.

413
41:17.560 --> 41:19.360
As you get older, you need to be even more careful.

414
41:20.440 --> 41:22.160
You need to be able to see through people, you know?

415
41:27.440 --> 41:28.880
If you're talking about Parn,

416
41:30.400 --> 41:33.000
I can tell you right here that she's a good person.

417
41:33.760 --> 41:36.120
I won't stop you from dating her.

418
41:37.600 --> 41:39.280
But do you really know her well?

419
41:39.280 --> 41:41.000
Have you seen every side of her?

420
41:42.360 --> 41:44.800
When you love or like someone,

421
41:45.280 --> 41:47.120
you tend to focus only on the good things.

422
41:47.960 --> 41:51.080
I just don't want you to get hurt like I did.

423
42:07.680 --> 42:09.840
You can set up the cake display case here.

424
42:09.840 --> 42:12.160
And put the cashier counter here.

425
42:12.920 --> 42:15.880
If you're interested, I can negotiate a special price for you.

426
42:16.920 --> 42:18.040
It can't be expensive, okay?

427
42:18.880 --> 42:19.800
Yeah.

428
42:20.840 --> 42:23.240
Thank you.

429
42:37.840 --> 42:38.920
- Peem. - Parn.

430
42:43.520 --> 42:44.640
You first.

431
42:45.240 --> 42:47.080
I found a place to open a bakery.

432
42:48.240 --> 42:49.440
You're opening one?

433
42:50.560 --> 42:51.880
Just a small one, though.

434
42:52.880 --> 42:54.800
What about you? What do you want to tell me?

435
42:58.480 --> 43:01.640
I found a new potential investor who doesn't seem difficult to deal with.

436
43:01.960 --> 43:02.880
Really?

437
43:04.880 --> 43:05.960
Also,

438
43:06.560 --> 43:07.960
I've made up with my dad.

439
43:09.600 --> 43:10.800
I'm so happy for you.

440
43:24.640 --> 43:25.440
Sis.

441
43:27.280 --> 43:28.440
Sis.

442
43:30.400 --> 43:31.520
Sis.

443
43:57.840 --> 43:58.880
Sis.

444
44:11.680 --> 44:13.920
Please don't hurt me.

445
44:14.400 --> 44:15.560
I'm begging you.

446
44:16.200 --> 44:17.440
Then give me back my money.

447
44:18.160 --> 44:19.920
I'm trying to get it.

448
44:20.240 --> 44:21.760
But I really don't have it right now.

449
44:24.240 --> 44:25.440
Then just sell the club.

450
44:26.560 --> 44:29.480
Or just give it to me, so we can get over this.

451
44:29.480 --> 44:31.520
Then what am I supposed to do to make a living?

452
44:33.520 --> 44:34.880
Make your choice.

453
44:34.880 --> 44:37.600
Do you want to keep the club, or your life?

454
44:39.120 --> 44:40.080
Sis!

455
44:40.680 --> 44:42.040
Parn. Parn.

456
44:42.600 --> 44:44.080
Parn, help me.

457
44:44.800 --> 44:46.000
Who are you guys?

458
44:46.400 --> 44:48.560
She owes me money but refuses to pay.

459
44:49.040 --> 44:49.800
How much?

460
44:49.800 --> 44:53.240
Ten million. Are you going to pay for her, huh?!

461
44:55.960 --> 44:57.360
If not, then move.

462
44:58.000 --> 45:00.600
If she doesn't pay me back today, I'll kill her.

463
45:06.320 --> 45:08.000
Can't you give me a little more time?

464
45:08.520 --> 45:10.280
I've given her enough already.

465
45:10.280 --> 45:11.840
But she just refused to pay. Huh?!

466
45:16.080 --> 45:17.680
I'll hurry and get the money to pay you back.

467
45:22.200 --> 45:23.160
One week.

468
45:24.320 --> 45:26.480
You must return the whole amount.

469
45:33.040 --> 45:33.880
Sis.

470
45:34.400 --> 45:35.520
- Parn. - Sis.

471
45:36.160 --> 45:37.280
You're okay.

472
45:37.600 --> 45:39.120
You're okay.

473
45:48.920 --> 45:51.240
If we can't find it in seven days,

474
45:51.240 --> 45:53.520
the two of us are surely dead.

475
45:55.520 --> 45:57.240
You didn't tell Ms. Peem?

476
45:57.240 --> 45:59.760
She thinks what I do is selling my body.

477
46:00.200 --> 46:02.600
If I told her and she didn't allow me to come, what would you do?

478
46:08.400 --> 46:10.240
Pack your things and get out of my house.

479
46:10.240 --> 46:11.840
Get out of my life.

480
46:12.280 --> 46:14.000
I don't want to see you again.

481
46:16.840 --> 46:24.000
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

482
46:24.000 --> 46:28.880
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

483
46:29.360 --> 46:32.040
♪ I don't understand ♪

484
46:32.040 --> 46:37.600
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

485
46:37.600 --> 46:42.320
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪
